00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.000
Hello, everyone, and welcome to the table.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.000
It is so good to see everybody here tonight.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.000
We're so glad to have you with us,

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.000
and that includes those of you joining us here online.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:36.000
Before we begin, I do have just a couple of announcements.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.000
First of all, as our relationship event coming up,

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.000
do you want to improve your relationship with a significant other?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.000
Regardless of your relationship status,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.000
whether you are married or just dating,

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.000
we hope you join us for a workshop

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:54.000
focused on enhancing communication skills

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.000
and navigating personality dynamics.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:05:01.000
Our hope is that through self-discovery and practical tools,

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:04.000
you can learn how to build a stronger partnership.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.000
You can RSVP by scanning the code on the screen,

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.000
or the code that will be on the screen momentarily,

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.000
and free child care will be available for those who attend.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.000
Secondly is Easter service coming up.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.000
Now, Jesus may have risen early on Easter Sunday,

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.000
but you don't have to.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.000
That is because our Easter service is going to be held

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:32.000
on Saturday evening, April 19th, at 5 p.m.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:36.000
So same time, same place, just a day early.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.000
And we hope you join us, not only for our service,

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.000
but for the community meal that we'll be having

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.000
at the Family Life Center afterwards.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:47.000
If you have any questions, you can get with me, with Brett,

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.000
or with any of the Elder Team members,

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:51.000
and we'll get you taken care of.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.000
Now, before we begin service,

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:57.000
Chloe Kaiser is going to start us off with a call to prayer.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:10.000
Now we exit the kingdom of noise, hurry, and productivity.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.000
Now we enter the kingdom of silence, stillness,

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.000
and simplicity, sacred space,

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.000
a place for prayer, worship, and adoration,

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.000
a place to behold Christ, revelation of God,

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.000
heartbeat of creation.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.000
Allow the unforced rhythms of grace to find you,

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.000
to mend your heart.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.000
May we all come home.

